{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_06",
  "title": "緊追猛趕",
  "storyCode": "DH-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a6921a643f8d5e546446796f270c3258427eb316105f90eb1e299986b289328d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "不愧是鼠膽龍威隊的兩位女俠，如果是戰鬥的話，她們就絕不會讓人失望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "她們輕鬆地解決了圍住她們的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "但是，此時第一梯隊已經遊過了一半距離！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "鼠膽龍威隊，趕得上嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "你在看什麼？該游泳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "我在想一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "什麼問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "既然我們認為埃內斯托有問題，而他又在我們後面，其實我們應該以他為優先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "有一定道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "但我們依然不能確定他就有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "而且，無論這背後是誰，很明顯，對方都不希望我們贏得比賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "但贏得比賽這個目的太寬泛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "也就是說，對方不希望我們上船，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "別廢話了，要輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "輸？不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "你先去吧，好久沒做類似的事了，我要做一些準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "經過短暫的討論後，不知為何，兩位女俠中，陳女俠先行下水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "而林女俠則留在沙灘上，一邊熱身，一邊似乎在從沙灘上收集沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "我們已經知道，林女俠的能力是將沙子變成玻璃作為武器，難道說，她要用沙子在海面上造出一座玻璃大橋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "要是爸爸的話，肯定能用這裡的沙子直接變出一座橋來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "不過，我可做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "但是，我也有我的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "這麼多沙子應該足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "陳暉潔的位置......正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "text": "呼......走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "這、這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "林女俠居然真的在海面上“走”了起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "text": "不，她並不是走，而是在跳躍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "text": "在她的每一個落腳點，都有她用沙子生成的玻璃作為支撐，供她進行下一次的跳躍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "text": "而且，她為了省沙子，如果就近有其他人，她就直接踩在那個人身上，用那個人的身體作為跳板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，有意思，太有意思了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "原來如此。這真是前所未有的渡海方式！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "也就是說，兩人是商量好，因為近海缺少跳板，所以由陳女俠來充當她的第一塊跳板，為林女俠的前進鋪平道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "兩人再一次向我們展現了她們令人感動的隊友情誼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，林小姐這方法確實出乎意料，但我覺得吧，她們一定沒有商量好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "text": "確實，鏡頭裡一閃而過的老陳那張臭臉太有趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "text": "嘖嘖，沒想到這兩個人合作起來這麼好玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "保持第一的依然是甜蜜夏日隊，嘉文選手以勢不可擋的勁頭向著終點進發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "其他隊伍也緊跟其後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "但是，他們都沒有想到，在他們的身後，還有一個林女俠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "她直接越過了第三名！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "第二名的頭也只能成為她的跳板！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "嘉文注意到她了，但是那又能怎麼樣呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "嘉文，嘉文也被林女俠無情地越過頭頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "第一，第一名是林小姐，第一名，依然是鼠膽龍威隊！！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "text": "這真是一場讓人熱血沸騰的逆轉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "喂，不是吧，這都能贏，真的假的，這未免也太犯規了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "哈哈，哈哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃內斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "這下，該怎麼辦好呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
